WEBVTT

00:04:27.054 --> 00:04:31.142
And thus they will never
fully, truly trust me.

00:04:31.726 --> 00:04:34.687
But that is the point of this whole talk.

00:04:35.229 --> 00:04:38.149
They're not supposed to trust me, you

00:04:38.149 --> 00:04:42.778
or anyone else coming in
with a grand plan to save the world.

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:45.406
They're supposed to trust themselves.

00:04:45.948 --> 00:04:48.451
Real community-based conservation

00:04:48.492 --> 00:04:53.456
goes much beyond ensuring an elder
has a ceremonial seat at the table

00:04:53.497 --> 00:04:54.832
and is interviewed.

00:04:55.166 --> 00:04:59.962
It fosters fierce independence,
doesn't further dependency.